{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261025/photo/bkn-20261025081141315-1025_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261025120305\"/><p>事主送往天水圍醫院。</p><p>天水圍有人在商場外暈倒。今晨(25日)7時38分，天華路33號一商場對開，有一名女子懷疑暈倒，由途人發現報案。救援人員接報到場，將昏迷姓黎(30歲)女事主送往天水圍醫院治理。警員調查後，將事件列作「有人暈倒」處理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:10.639552+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T00:11:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T08:58:05.836318+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:52:01.437167+00:00","content_hash":"10ac91c0be75ff67b5bfce1e51a85a4c72bed7fe90030a825a3f041ecef588ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:10.639552+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}